The data of src/azure-sizes-data.ts is not under the MIT License. It comes from the size
tables of the Azure documentation, Copyright Microsoft Corporation, in the repository
MicrosoftDocs/azure-compute-docs, under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The commit of the source is in the
file. The file keeps only the counts of vCPUs and the memory of each size.
